[{:db/id "q-154369/selection/c26ba6af9f56387385f8b7128a1c627a5fce5fb7a8a3275487fe498fbbcffead" :answer/id #uuid "f04e9899-6b36-5518-85d3-c461808ed265" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y={x}^{2}-2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-154369/selection/e57759c5c5f7ae6b3c2f7d8a6ec27524c235735b7adb5758e9d3091f72e127e0" :answer/id #uuid "ad191047-c971-55bb-8128-f0ada4a095ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2y}={x}^{2}-2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-154369/selection/75518a67d1c20e8a8dc2e2135d44a583b5fa412c988e7e8aeddcffed6d305c5e" :answer/id #uuid "7693381a-adc8-583e-94af-eadf35214759" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{y}={x}^{2}-2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-154369/selection/fd7b6090f5c472bc36ed0624c3a4d4ca734f68abf6e96fd3704ab2cf0d60b7a2" :answer/id #uuid "bf9a5b8d-2843-51eb-8e6f-76f48f63f4fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2y=\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}-x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-154369/selection/c0750b6ee76f9d927e0783036b3109fa2b6ba0188591d694fefd9b50b07997e7" :answer/id #uuid "80928768-2894-5d85-acfd-cfd9ea38e5e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2y}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{2}-x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-154369/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "12dab8f4-e734-5963-9693-5c1406154eb7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-154369/selection/75518a67d1c20e8a8dc2e2135d44a583b5fa412c988e7e8aeddcffed6d305c5e" :answer-field/choices ["q-154369/selection/c26ba6af9f56387385f8b7128a1c627a5fce5fb7a8a3275487fe498fbbcffead" "q-154369/selection/e57759c5c5f7ae6b3c2f7d8a6ec27524c235735b7adb5758e9d3091f72e127e0" "q-154369/selection/75518a67d1c20e8a8dc2e2135d44a583b5fa412c988e7e8aeddcffed6d305c5e" "q-154369/selection/fd7b6090f5c472bc36ed0624c3a4d4ca734f68abf6e96fd3704ab2cf0d60b7a2" "q-154369/selection/c0750b6ee76f9d927e0783036b3109fa2b6ba0188591d694fefd9b50b07997e7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-154369" :question/id #uuid "3385e109-e3cb-5f6a-8feb-75ceb2f55ae4" :question/math-academy-id "q-154369" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=2{e}^{-y}(x-1).$" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2{e}^{-y}(x-1) \\\\ {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2(x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\text{d}x & =\\int 2(x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x-\\int 2\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{y} & ={x}^{2}-2x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n{e}^{y}={x}^{2}-2x+C.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-154369/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a67b149c-f701-5be0-868d-c2f4a4be4be4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-154369"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009/selection/e28d82f817d1eff8c2caa77ad6a3bc8a9c903d608ee8a1ce0d4de7cab56822fa" :answer/id #uuid "9000bafb-6ff6-58fe-8e85-0ad592433b87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K{e}^{-3/x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009/selection/575af339e6b8a6a16131a4e0907608fbda5c95ebcb9f619933131d51264b3c88" :answer/id #uuid "eb037adf-0cb2-5567-a884-d4e68c98b5fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K{e}^{1/x}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009/selection/035fff8b0848906b972fb882e58f827e0cc383baa972f1c41e40f49f9bec4969" :answer/id #uuid "1e56dec5-b70f-5cf7-9d7d-32891777a0de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K{e}^{-1/x}-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009/selection/61d2b9c1b32ff08dde58cdb2c0cdaa7632ac90ca910846e11d3832b9b67fe0fe" :answer/id #uuid "8e9dbab8-ae4f-56e6-8695-b2f20aead6a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K{e}^{-x}-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009/selection/531aa9c4599bb9c214dc8314f651354d82a89b1148de3453a4ed5fd1769f44c5" :answer/id #uuid "2d125910-295e-59ed-8a6a-e393f3053a49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=K{e}^{x}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d3c1a1ea-775c-5824-ada6-11750b012916" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-158009/selection/035fff8b0848906b972fb882e58f827e0cc383baa972f1c41e40f49f9bec4969" :answer-field/choices ["q-158009/selection/e28d82f817d1eff8c2caa77ad6a3bc8a9c903d608ee8a1ce0d4de7cab56822fa" "q-158009/selection/575af339e6b8a6a16131a4e0907608fbda5c95ebcb9f619933131d51264b3c88" "q-158009/selection/035fff8b0848906b972fb882e58f827e0cc383baa972f1c41e40f49f9bec4969" "q-158009/selection/61d2b9c1b32ff08dde58cdb2c0cdaa7632ac90ca910846e11d3832b9b67fe0fe" "q-158009/selection/531aa9c4599bb9c214dc8314f651354d82a89b1148de3453a4ed5fd1769f44c5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-158009" :question/id #uuid "699032fa-9b2d-5062-8641-470288705407" :question/math-academy-id "q-158009" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation ${x}^{2}\\,{y}^{′}-y=3$ for $y\\ne -3.$" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}\\,{y}^{′}-y & =3 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-y & =3 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y+3 \\\\ \\frac{1}{y+3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y+3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y+3}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|y+3| & =-\\frac{1}{x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y+3|=-\\frac{1}{x}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y+3| & =-\\frac{1}{x}+C \\\\ |y+3| & ={e}^{-1/x+C} \\\\ |y+3| & ={e}^{-1/x}\\cdot {e}^{C} \\\\ |y+3| & =K{e}^{-1/x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K={e}^{C}$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|y+3| & =K{e}^{-1/x} \\\\ y+3 & =K{e}^{-1/x} \\\\ y & =K{e}^{-1/x}-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-158009/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "74b784e1-ad0e-5cf2-8b02-604a7098c6a9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-158009"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
